OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks allegedly fired at
OL,4,Adrivers on M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after
OL,7,Ffireworks were allegedly launched from
OL,8,Fa van at motorists on the M6.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the northbound
OL,11,Fmotorway on Monday evening and stopped
OL,12,Fthe vehicle after a short chase which
OL,13,Fended on Stafford Road in
OL,14,FWolverhampton, West Midlands Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FA search of the van found fireworks, a
OL,18,Fknife and a large wad of cash.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
