OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks allegedly fired at
OL,4,Adrivers on M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of failing to stop, dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving, driving without insurance and
OL,9,Fputting other road users at risk. A
OL,10,F21-year-old was arrested on suspicion
OL,11,Fof possessing an offensive weapon,
OL,12,Fendangering other road users and money
OL,13,Flaundering.
